        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "description": "The load-bearing event: one graded problem attempt (DATA_MODEL \u00a72).\n\n``attempt_id`` is a caller-supplied idempotency key (see deviations in the\ntask report) so ``cadus record`` can dedupe re-sent attempts.",
